wizard-awakened-greeting = The Winds have found you. Words and wisdom flood through you. You know your purpose: show the mortals what magic is. Open your Spellweaver's Tome and see what you can do.

primordial-vision-1 = For a moment the walls are somewhere else.
primordial-vision-2 = You hear your own name, spoken by something very large.
primordial-vision-3 = The air tastes like a book you have not read yet.
primordial-vision-4 = Your shadow is pointing in a direction you are not.
